# Bible Expert — OT Quality & Unified HTML Generator Investigation
**Date**: 2026-06-13 | **Job**: cdd60333 | **Confidence**: HIGH  
**Sources**: Head agent (direct DB + code inspection) + 5 parallel children (c1-internet, c2-kb, c3-context, c4-docs, c5-internal)

