## Contradictions Found and Resolutions

| Contradiction | c2-kb claim | Verified truth | Resolution |
|--------------|-------------|---------------|------------|
| OT patristic coverage | "only 5,037 entries" | **56,863 entries** (Psalms=21K, Genesis=9K, Isaiah=5K) | c2-kb was wrong; queried too narrowly |
| WLC word display in study.html | implied broken | Display works correctly (direction:rtl on container, individual spans join correctly RTL) | Not a bug — CSS direction:rtl on container reverses visual word order |

