### Priority 1 — Critical Fixes (Code Changes)

**1. Fix external links for Hebrew words** — `study_html_generator.py` lines 1215–1225 (5 min)
```javascript
// In openFullStudy():
const isHeb = (w.s || '').startsWith('H');
const hNum = isHeb ? (w.s || '').replace('H', '') : '';
if (isHeb) {
